Whispers of the Breeze
The morning sun with golden hue,
Paints the sky in pastel blue.
A gentle breeze begins to play,
Softly singing through the day.

The flowers wake with colors bright,
Dewdrops glisten in the light.
Birds take flight with songs so sweet,
A melody where earth and heaven meet.

The rivers dance, the forests sigh,
Clouds drift slowly, passing by.
Time stands still in moments rare,
A world so pure, beyond compare.

So pause a while, breathe it in,
Feel the joy that lies within.
For in this world, both vast and free,
Beauty waits for you and me.

Hope this brings a little peace to your day!